"entity": {
"name": "Neinor Homes SA",
"description": "Neinor Homes SA engages in the development of residential homes in Spain. Its product is multifamily homes targeted at the medium high end segments of the housing market. The firm operates through the following business lines: Development, Rental, Servicing, and Legacy. The Development business line is responsible for residential development business. The Rental business line focuses on provision of property and asset management services. The Servicing business line deals with the servicing of Kutxabank's portfolio. The Legacy business line is in charge of managing certain assets acquired from Kutxabank. The company was founded on December 4, 2014 and is headquartered in Madrid, Spain.",
